- It looks so delicious.

2141
01:16:33,580 --> 01:16:34,609
Thank you for the food.

2142
01:16:34,610 --> 01:16:36,880
- Thank you. Bon appetit.
- Bon appetit.

2143
01:16:38,050 --> 01:16:39,990
