2153
01:17:09,620 --> 01:17:11,679
I'm glad that we ordered kkanpunggi. It's very good.

2154
01:17:11,680 --> 01:17:12,690
Yes.

2155
01:17:12,820 --> 01:17:17,620
(Enjoying pleasant lunch together)

2156
01:17:17,860 --> 01:17:19,259
- It's delicious.
- Yes.

2157
01:17:19,260 --> 01:17:20,260
(Everyone is full and satisfied.)

2158
01:17:20,261 --> 01:17:22,099
You're always positive.

2159
01:17:22,100 --> 01:17:23,730
(Everyone is full and satisfied.)

2160
