- We understand.

2232
01:20:21,910 --> 01:20:24,010
"Kwang Soo, I love you."

2233
01:20:24,280 --> 01:20:28,080
"Kyung Soo, I love you."

2234
01:20:28,350 --> 01:20:32,080
"Big Brother Woo Bin, I love you."

2235
01:20:32,550 --> 01:20:35,620
"It was a pleasure working with you."

2236
01:20:37,620 --> 01:20:39,390
"I don't know..."

2237
