2252
01:21:19,100 --> 01:21:20,230
Me too.

2253
01:21:21,130 --> 01:21:22,239
Why do I feel this way?

2254
01:21:22,240 --> 01:21:23,240
"It's going to be hard..."

2255
01:21:23,241 --> 01:21:24,640
- "saying goodbye." - I know.

2256
01:21:24,900 --> 01:21:27,039
- It's annoying.
- It made me emotional.

2257
01:21:27,040 --> 01:21:28,109
It's annoying.

2258
01:21:28,110 --> 01:21:29,940
It's really annoying.

2259
01:21:32,510 --> 01:21:33,986
