"In recognition of these efforts, this certificate is awarded."

2272
01:22:02,710 --> 01:22:05,950
"April 16, 2026 at Gun Ranch."

2273
01:22:06,150 --> 01:22:07,180
"Ma Forest."

2274
01:22:07,680 --> 01:22:08,880
- Well done.
- Thank you.

2275
01:22:11,320 --> 01:22:12,350
That's good.

2276
01:22:12,620 --> 01:22:14,020
- Thank you.
- Well done.

2277
