2310
01:23:58,820 --> 01:24:00,190
I was inspired by...

2311
01:24:00,990 --> 01:24:03,730
their professionalism and their genuine love for horses.

2312
01:24:04,930 --> 01:24:06,700
It was fun. I enjoyed it.

2313
01:24:08,070 --> 01:24:10,870
I experienced so many emotions,

2314
01:24:11,140 --> 01:24:13,540
