2315
01:24:14,310 --> 01:24:17,180
It felt like we packed 48 hours into every single day.

2316
01:24:17,780 --> 01:24:18,910
- Thank you.
- Thank you.

2317
01:24:20,480 --> 01:24:21,810
Well done.

2318
01:24:22,080 --> 01:24:23,820
Kkalloo, let's take a photo together.

2319
01:24:24,580 --> 01:24:26,050
